# This root context is used only as the web image's named `repository_metadata`
# context. Keep it intentionally tiny: enough to resolve HEAD whether the ref
# is loose or packed, without sending source history, config, hooks or reflogs
# to the Docker builder.
*
!.git/
.git/*
!.git/HEAD
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/
!.git/refs/**
